From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 19:53:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Restore index.html entry point and bump to 0.1.7 (missed in
 prior commit)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The previous commit deleted the stale frontend/assets/ folder but
accidentally left index.html's fix and the version bump unstaged —
the actual root-cause fix (pointing index.html back at /src/main.tsx)
never made it into that commit, so the push it produced changed
nothing. This commit contains what should have been there originally.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01D9yfcLt9RHbqoZD18y9PT7
---
 home_energy_manager/config.yaml         | 2 +-
 home_energy_manager/frontend/index.html | 6 ++----
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/home_energy_manager/config.yaml b/home_energy_manager/config.yaml
index 2d7202b..993df3e 100644
--- a/home_energy_manager/config.yaml
+++ b/home_energy_manager/config.yaml
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 name: "Home Energy Manager"
 description: "Battery, EV charging, heat pump and peak-power management (fork of BESS Manager)"
-version: "0.1.6"
+version: "0.1.7"
 slug: "home_energy_manager"
 # No 'image' key, unlike upstream's ghcr.io/johanzander/bess-manager-{arch} —
 # there's no registry to publish this fork's image to, so the Supervisor
diff --git a/home_energy_manager/frontend/index.html b/home_energy_manager/frontend/index.html
index 3e800b2..2bff68f 100644
--- a/home_energy_manager/frontend/index.html
+++ b/home_energy_manager/frontend/index.html
@@ -4,11 +4,9 @@
     <meta charset="UTF-8" />
     <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
     <title>Battery Manager</title>
-    <script type="module" crossorigin src="./assets/main-Cn4ecN0M.js"></script>
-    <link rel="modulepreload" crossorigin href="./assets/vendor-c5ypKtDW.js">
-    <link rel="stylesheet" crossorigin href="./assets/main-B9fa0AUY.css">
   </head>
   <body>
     <div id="root"></div>
+    <script type="module" src="/src/main.tsx"></script>
   </body>
-</html>
\ No newline at end of file
+</html>
